{"id":"n71906-1-11","stage":5,"title":"의약품 · 医药品","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71906-1-11-1","ko":"손님, 이 약은 전문 의약품이라 의사의 처방전이 필요합니다.","zh":"顾客，这种药是处方药，需要医生的处方。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"손님,","meaning":"客人，顾客","explanation":"손님：客人，顾客","readings":[{"term":"손님","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71279","senseId":"2","lemma":"손님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"약은","meaning":"药","explanation":"약：药；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"약","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72379","senseId":"1","lemma":"약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전문","meaning":"专业","explanation":"전문：专业","readings":[{"term":"전문","audio":"/audio/cad3c263ff041670770c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70832","senseId":"1","lemma":"전문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"의약품이라","meaning":"医药品","explanation":"의약품：医药品；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"의약품","audio":"/audio/a41bd8383b3ba1ae00ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71906","senseId":"1","lemma":"의약품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"의사의","meaning":"医生","explanation":"의사：医生；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"의사","audio":"/audio/9b6834dbb2bfc221d4ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20256","senseId":"1","lemma":"의사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"처방전이","meaning":"药方","explanation":"처방전：药方；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"처방전","audio":"/audio/e94b916c687594791ceb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78726","senseId":"1","lemma":"처방전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"필요합니다.","meaning":"必需，必要","explanation":"필요하다：必需，必要；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"필요하다","audio":"/audio/b98947c9698402e3d07e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46945","senseId":"1","lemma":"필요하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3324c7e0bb86f28d","term":"손님","zh":"客人，顾客","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3","entryId":"71279","definition":"(尊称)来旅馆或餐厅等店铺的人。","pronunciation":["손님"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"2a9db5dfd1480367","term":"약","zh":"药","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3","entryId":"72379","definition":"为了治疗、预防病患或伤口，服用、抹、注射的物质。","pronunciation":["약"]},{"id":"cad3c263ff041670","term":"전문","zh":"专业","audio":"/audio/cad3c263ff041670770c.mp3","entryId":"70832","definition":"在某个领域中拥有许多知识和经验，只研究或负责该领域；或指该领域。","pronunciation":["전문"]},{"id":"a41bd8383b3ba1ae","term":"의약품","zh":"医药品","audio":"/audio/a41bd8383b3ba1ae00ec.mp3","entryId":"71906","definition":"用于治病的药品。","pronunciation":["의약품"]},{"id":"9b6834dbb2bfc221","term":"의사","zh":"医生","audio":"/audio/9b6834dbb2bfc221d4ef.mp3","entryId":"20256","definition":"具有一定资格、以诊断治疗病症为业的人。","pronunciation":["의사"]},{"id":"e94b916c68759479","term":"처방전","zh":"药方","audio":"/audio/e94b916c687594791ceb.mp3","entryId":"78726","definition":"为治疗疾病而开具的配药单子。","pronunciation":["처ː방전"]},{"id":"b98947c9698402e3","term":"필요하다","zh":"必需，必要","audio":"/audio/b98947c9698402e3d07e.mp3","entryId":"46945","definition":"一定要有的。","pronunciation":["피료하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7d657769dd207f11b650.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71906-1-11-2","ko":"아 그렇군요. 병원에 다녀와야겠어요.","zh":"啊，原来如此。那我得去一趟医院了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아","meaning":"哦","explanation":"아：哦","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"4","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇군요.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"병원에","meaning":"医院","explanation":"병원：医院；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"병원","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62271","senseId":"1","lemma":"병원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다녀와야겠어요.","meaning":"去一趟，去一下","explanation":"다녀오다：去一趟，去一下；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"다녀오다","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64529","senseId":"2","lemma":"다녀오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d6ce479be9ddc9b7","term":"아","zh":"哦","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3","entryId":"16247","definition":"由不知道而转向醒悟时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"4f4c2d79c47ca512","term":"병원","zh":"医院","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3","entryId":"62271","definition":"具备相关设施、由医生和护士治疗病人的地方。","pronunciation":["병ː원"]},{"id":"09b8a3cf21a41c7a","term":"다녀오다","zh":"去一趟，去一下","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3","entryId":"64529","definition":"为做某事而去某地后又回来。","pronunciation":["다녀오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/40f710fab9933e329b73.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.498,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71906","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":168,"sequenceScore":3.3247,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["啊，原来如此。那我得去一趟医院了。","顾客，这种药是处方药，需要医生的处方。","今天是第一次来公司上班，有什么感想吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["顾客，这种药是处方药，需要医生的处方。","今天是第一次来公司上班，有什么感想吗？","啊，原来如此。那我得去一趟医院了。"],"answer":2}]}
